          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आकाशवाणी — ākāśavāṇī — “radio.” The Kosha Sanskrit Today radio entry explicitly attests this modern use. This tranche teaches only the modern radio meaning. It does not ask you to generalise from the word's older “voice from the sky” sense."
            }
